---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Applied Robotics Lab privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your data."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy', i18nKey: 'privacy.title' }]}
>
  <section class="section bg-navy-900">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black mb-8 text-slate-900" data-i18n="privacy.title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-10" data-i18n="privacy.last_updated">Last updated: July 1, 2026</p>
      <div class="prose-arl space-y-6">
        <p data-i18n="privacy.intro">Applied Robotics Lab ("ARL", "we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy describes what data we collect, why, and how we protect it.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h1">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.p1">We collect information you voluntarily provide through our contact form, including your name, email address, company name, and message content. We do not sell this data.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-i18n="privacy.li2.1">To respond to your inquiries</li>
          <li data-i18n="privacy.li2.2">To notify you about product updates you've requested</li>
          <li data-i18n="privacy.li2.3">To improve our products and services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h3">3. Analytics</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.p3">We may use privacy-respecting analytics tools (e.g., Umami or Plausible) that do not track individuals, use cookies, or share data with third parties. Analytics are aggregated and anonymous.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h4">4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.p4">Contact form submissions are retained for up to 2 years unless you request deletion earlier.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h5">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="privacy.p5.html">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@arl.lab">hello@arl.lab</a>.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h6">6. Security</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.p6">We use HTTPS and industry-standard security practices. Contact form data is transmitted securely and stored with restricted access.</p>

        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.h7">7. Contact</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="privacy.p7.html">For privacy-related questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@arl.lab">hello@arl.lab</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
